Main CHIP2 data in here:
- 2023-designData: data for the designs in CHIP2
- vdw_paper_data: finalized data for the CHIP2 designs and for the vdW paper
- analyses: analysis code for CHIP2 (including hydrogen bond data)
  - To run:
    - python3 runAllAnalysis.py -config config/fullAnalysis_2024-7_7_updatedRepacks.config
      - will need to change the config file arguments that designate paths to run on your own system
- Cloning: cloning data for CHIP2 library and sequencing of the library